    "dose": "Mild to moderate pain. Oral: Infant or Child over 3 months 5–10 mg/kg three or four times daily with or after food. Maximum daily dose is 40 mg/kg/day.  2.1 Non-opioids and non-steroidal anti-inflammatory medicines (NSAIMs) retention may occur as may deterioration in renal function possibly leading to renal failure. Moderate to severe: avoid.",
