    "dose": "Allergy. Oral: 1–2 years 1 mg twice daily; 2–6 years 1 mg every 4–6 hours (maximum 6 mg daily); 6–12 years 2 mg every 4–6 hours (maximum 12 mg daily). Allergic reactions, anaphylaxis (adjunct). SC, IM or IV: Child under 1 year not recommended; 1–6 years 2.5–5 mg; 6–12 years 5–10 mg.",
