    "dose": "Oral: 6 hours may be used in severe infections. The same daily dose may be given twice daily for uncomplicated urinary tract infections, streptococcal pharyngitis and tonsillitis, skin and soft tissue infections, however this is not recommended if > 500 mg per dose is required.",
