    "adverseEffects": "Uncommon Allergic reactions, fever. Rare Seizures, fainting. Interactions with other medicines (* indicates severe): Phenobarbital: plasma concentration of phenobarbital possibly reduced. Phenytoin: plasma phenytoin concentration possibly reduced. Fluorouracil: toxicity enhanced but used for this purpose intentionally. Trimethoprim: reduced therapeutic effect.",
    "notes": "Also referred to as calcium leucovorin, folinic acid or leucovorin.",
    "sourcePage": 8,
