    "indications": "Assessment of renal function; cerebral oedema; raised intraocular pressure (emergency treatment or before surgery).",
    "contraindications": "Pulmonary oedema; intracranial bleeding (except during craniotomy); severe congestive heart failure; metabolic oedema with abnormal capillary fragility; severe dehydration; renal failure (unless test dose produces diuresis).",
