    "precautions": "Anaphylaxis, although rare, may occur; concomitant or recent use of live virus vaccines (see below). Live virus vaccines Immunoglobulins may interfere with the immune response to live virus vaccines, which should be administered 3 weeks before or 3 months after immunoglobulin.",
