    "specialNotes": "Influenza viruses type A and B are common causes of respiratory illnesses and are Active immunization against influenza in individuals at risk. IM: Infant or Child 6 months–3 years 0.25 ml (one or two doses); Child over 3 years 0.5 ml (one or two doses). Note A second dose after at least 4 weeks is recommended in previously unvaccinated children 6 months to 9 years of age.  19 Immunologicals",
