    "dose": "Prevention of dental caries. Oral rinse: Child over 6 years 10 ml of a 0.05% solution daily or 10 ml of a 0.2% solution weekly.",
    "renalImpairment": "Dose reduction not necessary.",
    "hepaticImpairment": "Dose reduction not necessary.",
    "adverseEffects": "In recommended doses toxicity is unlikely. Uncommon Occasional white flecks (fluorosis) on teeth at recommended doses. Rare Yellowish-brown discoloration of teeth if recommended doses are exceeded. Excessive intake may lead to osteosclerosis and bone deformities. Interactions with other medicines (* indicates severe): There are no known interactions involving a significant change in effect or where it is recommended to avoid concomitant use.",
